flowchart TD
  A["Venus QuickJS：撤回操作或 type-3 同步事实"] --> B["读取 `message.timeline`、`message.thread-detail`、`message.left-dialog-list` 完整 VM"]
  B --> C["Frame 内 `ActionBinding(revoke)` / `Inbound`"]
  C --> D["native 注入 actor/requestId/observedRevision/surfaceEpoch"]
  D --> E["ActionInvocationEnvelope / HostObservation / Inbound"]
  E --> F["MobileImSdk -> CoreBridge -> helix-driver-ffi"]
  F --> G["`Tick::Command/Inbound/PortReply/Timer`"]
  G --> H["`http_write`、`storage_upsert`、`projection`、`sync_request`"]
  H --> I["Go authority：`POST /api/cses/posts/revoke` body `{postId}`"]
  I --> J["WS/PortReply：`posts_update`, `post_update`, `update_channel`"]
  J --> K["`PersistAtomic -> PersistOk`；SQLite `message`"]
  K --> L{"PersistOk?"}
  L -- "否" --> X["保留旧 VM；ActionReceipt failed；可重试"]
  L -- "是" --> M["SurfaceComposer：`message.timeline`、`message.thread-detail`、`message.left-dialog-list`"]
  M --> N["InteractionFrameV2 schemaVersion=2"]
  N --> O["FFI batch -> C++ SurfaceRuntime 整帧校验"]
  O --> P{"epoch/revision/causation 合法?"}
  P -- "否" --> Y["保留最后一致 VM；请求 snapshot/resync"]
  P -- "是" --> Q["原子提交 TimelineWindowVm + ThreadDetailVm + DialogListVm"]
  Q --> R["QuickJS im.surface.view/pending"]
  R --> S["移动 UI：发送者撤回后时间线、线程和会话摘要同步显示撤回态，原操作按钮失效"]
  S --> T["FrameApplied / directive ack / action terminal"]
